\ Render names from canonical indices only AFTER the date succeeded.
\ This check avoids gate calculations: it tests the display adapter
\ independently of the sauce and of the year-selection algorithm.

To check the English complete date text:
  Put 1 into the complete date status.
  Put 5000 into the complete date answer's year number.
  Put 10 into the complete date answer's cutlet name index.
  Put 503 into the complete date answer's cutlet day.
  Put 20 into the complete date answer's month name index.
  Put 56 into the complete date answer's month day.
  Render the complete date in English.
  If the complete English date text is not "5000, Scorpion, 503, Well, 56",
    put "The Foundation English date rendering does not match its names." into the check report; exit.
  Put 0 into the complete date status.
  Render the complete date in English.
  If the complete English date text is not "",
    put "An invalidated date was rendered with stale English text." into the check report; exit.
  Put 1 into the complete date status.
  Put 48 into the complete date answer's month name index.
  Render the complete date in English.
  If the complete English date text is not "",
    put "An unknown month index was rendered as a valid English date." into the check report; exit.
  Reset the complete date answer.
